# One folder per domain module from the OutingCo brief, e.g.
#   auth/  outings/  bookings/  clients/  transport/  post-outing/
#
# Each feature owns its own screens and internals:
#
#   features/<feature>/
#   ├── pages/       route-level screens for this feature
#   ├── components/  UI used only by this feature
#   ├── hooks/       hooks used only by this feature
#   └── api/         requests for this feature
#
# Anything reused by more than one feature moves up into
# src/components, src/hooks or src/lib. Page framing lives in src/layouts.
